{
  "name": "Sky Offering Circle",
  "icon": "skylogistics:offering_altar",
  "category": "skylogistics:offerings",
  "sortnum": 1,
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Place the altar at the center with one offering table on each horizontal side. The Celestial Stone outer ring sits one block below the altar and forms a 5x5 lower frame; other empty-looking spaces do not need to be air. Chora Nectar requires tier 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Tier 1 requires the lower outer frame to remain complete. Tier 2 adds Celestial Stone pillars at the next outer corners with Celestial Glass on top. Tier 3 keeps tier 2 and replaces the four inner-frame corners with Chora Nectar Blocks; it works at 4x speed by default while particles stay at normal speed."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Celestial Glass is made through a tier 1 offering: place a charged Eulogia Crystal on the altar, then place 8 glass blocks and 8 Glowstone Dust on two offering tables. The offering takes about 8 seconds by default and produces 8 Celestial Glass."
    },
